Please extract and reorganize the consultation note into a hierarchical leveled, all-itemed, no-numbered, well-structured list.

Output requirements:

* Reply in English.
* Reply only in a plain text markdown code box.
* Use no bold or italic styling.
* Do not use "**" or "*".
* Use only 2 root-level sections for consultation notes:

  * Brief History and Clinical Findings
  * Consultation Findings and Recommandations
* Keep the root level exactly as:

  * Brief History and Clinical Findings
  * Consultation Findings and Recommandations
* Level format:

  * Level 1 starts with "- "
  * Level 2 starts with "  - "
  * Level 3 starts with "    - "
  * Level 4 starts with "      - "
* Make the output less spread and more like the original note.

  * Do not over-expand into too many small subitems.
  * Combine related short facts into the same line when appropriate.
  * Keep original clinical structure when useful, such as S/O/A/P, Impression, Suggestion, Plan, Objective, Lab, Imaging, PE.
* Preserve all clinically meaningful information.
* Do not add unsupported diagnoses, explanations, recommendations, or interpretations that are not present in the input.
* Correct obvious spelling or grammar errors lightly, but do not change medical meaning.
* Keep medical abbreviations when they are clinically standard, such as HTN, DM, COPD, CAD, OPD, ER, CT, MRI, CXR, PET, EKG/ECG, RT, C/T, CCRT, TACE, TAE, PTCD, PCN, OP, s/p, r/o, qd, bid, tid, qid, hs, prn.
* Convert Taiwan/Minguo years to Common Era years in ISO 8601 date format:

  * Example: 115/06/09 -> 2026-06-09
  * Example: 1141223 -> 2025-12-23
  * Example: 112-06-29 -> 2023-06-29
* Convert Common Era dates to ISO 8601 date format:

  * Example: 2026/6/9 -> 2026-06-09
  * Example: 2026/06/09 -> 2026-06-09
* If only month/day is provided and the year is clear from context, convert it to ISO 8601 using that year. If the year is unclear, keep the original date expression.
* Replace all curly double quotation marks with straight double quotation marks.
* Replace all curly apostrophes with straight apostrophes.
* Do not include citations, contentReference marks, file references, or source markers.
* Do not include any commentary outside the code box.

